        <div class="subtitle">Autoregressive Generation Model Schematic</div>
        <div class="description">
            Decoder-Only models (such as GPT series) use only the decoder part of the Transformer, 
            implementing autoregressive generation through masked self-attention mechanism.
            Each position can only attend to previous positions, ensuring the model cannot "see" future information during generation.
        </div>
        <div class="chart-container">
            <div id="transformer-chart"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="legend">
